Graph Cache is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for caching, validating, reusing, invalidating, persisting, and replaying executable AI execution graphs with compatibility-safe lookup and accelerator-aware lifecycle management.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Graph Cache does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Graph Cache accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on
the terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.

